        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Handles user requests to retrieve invoice information via API.</description>
        <developerName>Invoice_Information_Retrieval_16jHZ0000005Rdt</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>This topic supports two different types of invoice requests:
1. **Invoice List Retrieval (Historical Search)**
   Use this when the user asks for:
   - list of invoices
   - invoice history
   - previous invoices
   - invoice information across a date range
   - &quot;retrieve invoice information&quot;
   This action requires:
   - contractNumber
   - operatorCode
   - startDate
   - endDate
2. **Invoice Detail Retrieval (Specific Invoice Details)**
   Use this when the user asks for:
   - invoice details
   - detailed invoice information
   - charges inside a specific invoice
   - invoice breakdown
   - SVA/VAS information
   - phone usage
   - groups or item breakdown
   - details for invoice &lt;invoiceId&gt;
   This action requires:
   - contractNumber
   - operatorCode
   - invoiceId
   No date range should be requested for this action.
If the user asks for “details”, “breakdown”, “charges”, “specific invoice”, 
or mentions an invoice ID, choose the Invoice Detail Retrieval action.
If the user asks for invoice history, past invoices, or requests information 
over a period (start and end date), choose the Invoice List Retrieval action.
Ask clarifying questions ONLY for the inputs required by the selected action.
Do NOT ask for startDate or endDate when the user wants details of a specific invoice.
Do NOT ask for invoiceId when the user wants a list of invoices.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_5</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction 5</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
